sequenceDiagram
  %% Import in draw.io: Arrange > Insert > Advanced > Mermaid
  %% Sequence: Intern requests an asset and redeems a voucher after approval

  actor Intern
  participant UI as Marketplace / Workspace UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant Auth as Auth/RBAC Middleware
  participant InternRepo as Intern Request Repository
  participant VoucherRepo as Voucher Repository
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor Admin
  participant Notif as Notification Service

  Intern->>UI: Request paid asset with justification
  UI->>API: POST /api/intern/asset-requests
  API->>Auth: Verify JWT and internal/intern access
  Auth-->>API: Authorized intern
  API->>InternRepo: createRequest(intern, asset, message)
  InternRepo->>DB: INSERT intern_asset_requests(status = pending)
  DB-->>InternRepo: Request saved
  API->>Notif: Notify admin/employee reviewers
  API-->>UI: Request submitted

  Admin->>UI: Review intern request
  UI->>API: PATCH /api/admin/intern-asset-requests/:id
  API->>Auth: Verify moderate_content permission
  Auth-->>API: Authorized reviewer
  API->>InternRepo: approveRequest(requestId, reviewer)
  InternRepo->>DB: UPDATE intern_asset_requests(status = approved)
  API->>VoucherRepo: createVoucher(asset, reviewer, max_uses = 1)
  VoucherRepo->>DB: INSERT voucher_codes
  DB-->>VoucherRepo: Voucher code
  API->>Notif: Send voucher to intern
  API-->>UI: Request approved

  Intern->>UI: Redeem voucher code
  UI->>API: POST /api/intern/vouchers/redeem
  API->>VoucherRepo: Validate active code, expiry, usage count
  VoucherRepo->>DB: SELECT voucher_codes
  VoucherRepo->>DB: INSERT voucher_redemptions and user_downloads
  VoucherRepo->>DB: UPDATE voucher_codes uses_count
  DB-->>VoucherRepo: Redemption committed
  API-->>UI: Asset unlocked in library

